    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Nemtly Blocks is a powerful collection of animated Gutenberg blocks designed to make your WordPress site stand out. Add professional animations, effects, and interactive elements to your content with ease.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Animated Text Effects</strong>: Choose from multiple text animation styles including fade-in, scale-in, rotate-in, rise-up, tumble-in, elastic-scale, anime-text-scale, zoom-out-text, and more</li>\n<li><strong>Advanced Image Block</strong>: Enhanced image block with additional styling and animation options</li>\n<li><strong>Rating Block</strong>: Add star ratings to your content</li>\n<li><strong>Visual Effects</strong>: Cosmic neon effects, shimmer lines, animated ribbons, perspective text, and line revealer animations</li>\n<li><strong>Particle Container</strong>: Interactive particle background container with mouse-responsive effects</li>\n<li><strong>Fade Effects</strong>: Fade-in and fade-away animations for smooth transitions</li>\n<li><strong>Custom Block Category</strong>: All blocks are organized in a dedicated &#8220;Nemtly&#8221; category for easy access</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Available Blocks:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Advanced Image</li>\n<li>Animated Ribbon</li>\n<li>Anime Text Scale</li>\n<li>Cosmic Neon</li>\n<li>Elastic Scale</li>\n<li>Fade Away</li>\n<li>Fade In</li>\n<li>Line Revealer</li>\n<li>Perspective Text</li>\n<li>Rating</li>\n<li>Rise Up</li>\n<li>Rotate In</li>\n<li>Scale In</li>\n<li>Shimmer Lines</li>\n<li>Tumble In</li>\n<li>Zoom Out Text</li>\n<li>Particle Container</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All blocks are fully customizable and work seamlessly with the WordPress block editor. Simply add a block, customize the settings, and watch your content come to life with smooth, professional animations.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/nemtly-blocks</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n<li>Start using the blocks by adding them from the block inserter in the &#8220;Nemtly&#8221; category</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"what%20wordpress%20version%20do%20i%20need%3F\">\nWhat WordPress version do I need?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>This plugin requires WordPress 6.7 or higher and PHP 7.4 or higher.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"do%20these%20blocks%20work%20with%20all%20themes%3F\">\nDo these blocks work with all themes?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, these blocks are designed to work with any WordPress theme that supports the block editor.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20customize%20the%20animations%3F\">\nCan I customize the animations?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, each block comes with customizable settings that allow you to adjust animation timing, effects, and styling to match your site&#8217;s design.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"are%20the%20blocks%20accessible%3F\">\nAre the blocks accessible?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, all blocks are built with accessibility in mind and follow WordPress accessibility guidelines.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n<li>Added 17 animated Gutenberg blocks</li>\n<li>Custom block category integration</li>\n<li>Full WordPress 6.7+ compatibility</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A collection of premium animated Gutenberg blocks to enhance your WordPress site with beautiful animations and effects.",
    "description": "<p>Nemtly Blocks is a powerful collection of animated Gutenberg blocks designed to make your WordPress site stand out. Add professional animations, effects, and interactive elements to your content with ease.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Animated Text Effects</strong>: Choose from multiple text animation styles including fade-in, scale-in, rotate-in, rise-up, tumble-in, elastic-scale, anime-text-scale, zoom-out-text, and more</li>\n<li><strong>Advanced Image Block</strong>: Enhanced image block with additional styling and animation options</li>\n<li><strong>Rating Block</strong>: Add star ratings to your content</li>\n<li><strong>Visual Effects</strong>: Cosmic neon effects, shimmer lines, animated ribbons, perspective text, and line revealer animations</li>\n<li><strong>Particle Container</strong>: Interactive particle background container with mouse-responsive effects</li>\n<li><strong>Fade Effects</strong>: Fade-in and fade-away animations for smooth transitions</li>\n<li><strong>Custom Block Category</strong>: All blocks are organized in a dedicated &#8220;Nemtly&#8221; category for easy access</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Available Blocks:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Advanced Image</li>\n<li>Animated Ribbon</li>\n<li>Anime Text Scale</li>\n<li>Cosmic Neon</li>\n<li>Elastic Scale</li>\n<li>Fade Away</li>\n<li>Fade In</li>\n<li>Line Revealer</li>\n<li>Perspective Text</li>\n<li>Rating</li>\n<li>Rise Up</li>\n<li>Rotate In</li>\n<li>Scale In</li>\n<li>Shimmer Lines</li>\n<li>Tumble In</li>\n<li>Zoom Out Text</li>\n<li>Particle Container</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All blocks are fully customizable and work seamlessly with the WordPress block editor. Simply add a block, customize the settings, and watch your content come to life with smooth, professional animations.</p>\n",
